     [38;5;246mBatch and POST records to a configurable URL. Zero dependencies. Requires you to have or build a receiver — pick [39m
     [38;5;246mthis only if that exists.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Third-party service
     [38;5;246mSentry or similar SDK handles transport, retry, and search. Fastest real visibility; adds a dependency and sends [39m
